;;|| NEXT >
;;
;;AQP-G13 — the three "Invalid FVT reward pipeline" guards.
;;
;;These sit LAST in each stake flow, behind class, admission and (for two of them) arity. Reaching
;;one needs a pool that is fully stake-ready EXCEPT that its employed score has no enabled FVT
;;ScoreEntityLink -- and every pool in the suite ships fvt-ready. Rather than build such a pool,
;;the link is toggled OFF and back ON around each assertion: C_ToggleScoreEntityLink is the
;;supported operation for exactly this, so the fixture is two client calls rather than a new pool.
;;
;;All three flows are driven separately. The message is identical at all three sites, and the
;;coverage tool cannot tell same-module sites apart -- so driving one would have credited three
;;and left two of them fiction, the same trap AQP-G11/G12 closed for the admission guard.
;;
;;Each toggle is its own transaction (one IGNIS-collecting client op per tx) and is called WITHOUT
;;a (try ...) wrapper, because it writes and Pact forbids database writes inside `try`.

(begin-tx "AQP-G13a-off — disable the true-fungible pool's FVT ScoreEntityLink")
(env-gasmodel "table")(env-gaslimit 10000000)(env-gas 0)
(namespace "ouronet-ns")
(print "--- [AQP-G13a-off · 01 · unlink ResumeVacScore] ---")
;;==== AQP-G13a-off — disable the true-fungible pool's FVT ScoreEntityLink · 01 · env-sigs (caps) ==== 
(print "--- [AQP-G13a-off — disable the true-fungible pool's FVT ScoreEntityLink · 01 · env-sigs (caps)] ---")
(env-sigs [{ "key": "PK_AncientHodler", "caps": [] }])
;;==== AQP-G13a-off — disable the true-fungible pool's FVT ScoreEntityLink · 02 · let / invocation ==== 
(print "--- [AQP-G13a-off — disable the true-fungible pool's FVT ScoreEntityLink · 02 · let / invocation] ---")
(let
    (
        (ref-U|DALOS:module{UtilityDalosV2} U|DALOS)
        (ref-TS02-C3:module{TalosStageTwo_ClientThreeV1} TS02-C3)
    )
    (ref-TS02-C3::AQP-FVT|C_ToggleScoreEntityLink KST.ANHD (AQP-FVT.UR_FVT|OwnerKonto (ref-U|DALOS::UDC_Makeid "ResumeVacVault"))
        (ref-U|DALOS::UDC_Makeid "ResumeVacVault") 1 (ref-U|DALOS::UDC_Makeid "ResumeVacScore") false)
    ""
)
(commit-tx)

;;|| NEXT >
