(begin-tx "AQP-G16 — SCR|XI>ISSUE-SCORE: the shape gate, then the class/lp-denominator rule behind it")
(env-gasmodel "table")(env-gaslimit 10000000)(env-gas 0)
(namespace "ouronet-ns")
(print "--- [AQP-G16 · 01 · score issuance admission] ---")
;;Both guards are @event-cap guards reached through the ordinary Talos client path — the route
;;established in AQP-G14, since `test-capability` cannot acquire an @event defcap.
;;
;;The first is an eight-way fold over the issuance shape: score-class 0..4, precision 3..24, three
;;multipliers strictly positive, and an nft-score-model of -1, 0 or 1. Two different inputs are
;;driven through it — an out-of-range precision and an out-of-range nft model — because a fold
;;that had dropped a conjunct would still reject the first and quietly accept the second.
;;
;;The second guard is the one that needed care. It states the class/lp-denominator contract:
;;class 0 (liquidity) scores MUST name an lp-denominator, classes 1-4 must NOT. Reaching it means
;;passing the fold above first, which my first attempt did not — precision 2 and zero multipliers
;;tripped the shape gate and the assertion would have been passing for the wrong reason. The call
;;below uses precision 3 and positive multipliers so the ONLY thing wrong is the BAR denominator.
;;==== AQP-G16 — SCR|XI>ISSUE-SCORE: the shape gate, then the class/lp-denominator rule behind it · 01 · env-sigs (caps) ==== 
(print "--- [AQP-G16 — SCR|XI>ISSUE-SCORE: the shape gate, then the class/lp-denominator rule behind it · 01 · env-sigs (caps)] ---")
(env-sigs [{ "key": "PK_AncientHodler", "caps": [] }])
;;==== AQP-G16 — SCR|XI>ISSUE-SCORE: the shape gate, then the class/lp-denominator rule behind it · 02 · let / invocation ==== 
(print "--- [AQP-G16 — SCR|XI>ISSUE-SCORE: the shape gate, then the class/lp-denominator rule behind it · 02 · let / invocation] ---")
(let
    (
        (ref-TS02-C3:module{TalosStageTwo_ClientThreeV1} TS02-C3)
    )
    (map print
        [
            (expect-failure "<<AQP-G16>> a precision outside 3..24 is refused"
                "Invalid precision, score-class, mx-frozen, mx-sleeping, mx-hibernated or nft-score-model"
                (ref-TS02-C3::AQP-SCR|C_IssueSemiFungibleScore KST.ANHD KST.ANHD "BadPrecScore" 99 false))
            (expect-failure "<<AQP-G16>> ...and an nft-score-model outside {-1,0,1} likewise"
                "Invalid precision, score-class, mx-frozen, mx-sleeping, mx-hibernated or nft-score-model"
                (ref-TS02-C3::AQP-SCR|C_IssueNonFungibleScore KST.ANHD KST.ANHD "BadNftScore" 2 99))
            ;;valid shape, so the fold passes and only the denominator rule is left to object
            (expect-failure "<<AQP-G16>> a class-0 liquidity score with a BAR lp-denominator is refused"
                "lp-denominator must be non-BAR for class 0 and BAR for classes 1-4"
                (ref-TS02-C3::AQP-SCR|C_IssueLiquidityScore KST.ANHD KST.ANHD "BadLpScore" 3 "|" 1.0 1.0))
        ]
    )
    ""
)
(commit-tx)

